CM_ BO_ 68 "Via Motors TRAC (traction) MCU. Symmetric to GENE 0x0054 on PT bus (+0x10 offset).";

CM_ BO_ 201 "GM PPEI engine speed. B0 not read by EPRI app.";

CM_ BO_ 288 "GM PPEI vehicle odometer. B0 not read. EPRI app displays in miles but km value is authoritative (scale 0.015625 km/count).";

CM_ BO_ 451 "GM PPEI engine torque. Both signals share scale/offset. Zero torque at raw=1696.";

CM_ BO_ 707 "GM PPEI manifold absolute pressure. EPRI plist label 'PPEI_Engine_Torque_Status_3' is the PPEI message name (correct per GM spec); MAP is one of several signals. B0-B5, B7 not read by EPRI app.";

CM_ BO_ 977 "GM PPEI instantaneous fuel consumption. EPRI plist label 'PPEI_Engine_General_Status_2' is the PPEI message name (correct per GM spec); fuel rate is one of several signals (message also contains throttle, cruise speed, AC command).";

CM_ BO_ 1001 "GM PPEI vehicle speed and distance. plist index .2 is a placeholder (value=-1). B4-B7 not read.";

CM_ BO_ 1105 "EPRI ID CONFLICT: plist attributed as TRAC_Mot_Trq but this is GMLAN Gateway_LS_General_Information. SG_ entries removed. GMLAN signals belong in GMW8762_PPEI_GMLAN.dbc.";

CM_ BO_ 1098 "EPRI ID ERROR: plist predicted 0x459 (wrong -0x020 offset from GENE 0x479); actual ID is 0x44A (-0x02F offset). 0x459 has zero frames in all captured logs. Symmetric to GENE 0x0479. B3 is a rolling counter.";

CM_ BO_ 1113 "EPRI ID ERROR: 0x459 has zero frames in all captured logs. Actual message is at 0x44A (see BO_ 1098). SG_ entries removed per DBC signal policy.";

CM_ BO_ 1122 "Via Motors TRAC MCU HV bus current and voltage. Symmetric to GENE 0x0482 on PT bus (+0x20 offset). B5 uncharacterized.";

CM_ BO_ 1217 "GM PPEI engine temperatures. B0-B3 and B7 not read by EPRI app.";

CM_ SG_ 1217 ECM_OutsideAirTemp "Resolution 0.5 degC (unlike coolant/intake which are 1.0 degC).";


CM_ SG_ 68 TRAC_RotSpd "Zero at raw=32767 (1-count offset vs PT bus 0x5A2 which uses 32768).";
CM_ SG_ 68 TRAC_EmergcyStp_flg "Traction MCU emergency stop flag. Symmetric to GENE_EmergcyStp_flg.";




CM_ SG_ 707 MAP "Unsigned (EPRI app reads as signed but unsigned is correct; sea-level ~101 kPa = raw 202).";



CM_ SG_ 1098 TRAC_DrvCoolFlowReq_pct "Inverter (drive) cooling flow request. Symmetric to GENE_DrvCoolFlowReq_pct (0x0479 B0). Scale assumed by structural symmetry.";
CM_ SG_ 1098 TRAC_MotCoolFlowReq_pct "Saturates at 100% under sustained traction thermal stress.";
CM_ SG_ 1098 TRAC_ThermInd_pct "r=+1.000 vs 0x06000002 B5/B6 (PT bus VCU re-broadcast). B3 is a rolling counter -- not a signal.";


CM_ SG_ 1122 TRAC_HighPwr_Curr "Same layout as GENE_HighPwr_Curr (log-validated on 0x0482).";
CM_ SG_ 1122 TRAC_HighPwr_Volt "Same layout as GENE_HighPwr_Volt (log-validated on 0x0482).";

